#### **3. Advanced Simulation Techniques**
Implementing an inverse cubic gravitational model requires advanced computational strategies:

**Implementation Pattern: Inverse Cubic Contribution Calculation**
```cpp
void updateObjectPosition(GameObject& obj, const std::vector<CelestialBody>& celestialBodies) {
    Vec3 net_force = Vec3(0, 0, 0);

    for (const auto& body : celestialBodies) {
        Vec3 gravitational_force = body.calculateGravitationalForce(obj);
        net_force += gravitational_force;
    }

    // Update object's velocity and position based on net gravitational force
    obj.updateVelocity(net_force);
    obj.updatePosition();
}
